{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/ff6e8404eb1c628338af61b7b56c40bb5338d9b2590806e1e9a32aa689150943db14bef9f2b47769b7e8ebe10a23579ff9e48b6349c130aeb735485692719eae","height":592,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/z96aWVrhN8qLx3VA5w-s6zIbGJo0YKZOoBEVTRsOwNxxsmCV5SJqGQW3fGiFZsUDqmdHjqGS2_FDAPktI1HTFSHhqEBNin6p6j1PUw","width":596},"name":"Jonathan Bingham","title":"Material Design Product Manager"},"document_id":6298722559066112,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; max-width: 100%; height: 0;\"><iframe style=\"border-radius: 16px; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/y2zMJqM0lAw\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div>\n<p>你创建过网站吗？如果创建过，那你很有可能就是用 WordPress 搭建的 &ndash; 互联网上所有网站中有 <a href=\"https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">40%</a>（！）都在使用这个内容管理系统。</p>\n<p>Material Design 为构建 Web 体验提供了原则、图标和指南，这些同样适用于 WordPress 网站。因此，我们推出了 <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/material-design/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Material Design for WordPress</a> &ndash; 一款实验性的插件和主题，它可以自定义导航、颜色、字体排印和形状，还能为 WordPress 网站提供完整的 Google Fonts 和 Material Design 图标。</p>\n<h2>获取插件</h2>\n<p>准备好动手试一试了吗？只需按照下面的说明操作，并继续阅读，看看这款插件都能做些什么。</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">如果你还没有托管的 WordPress 网站，可以在 </span><a style=\"text-decoration-line: none;\" href=\"https://wordpress.org/download/\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: #1155cc; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; text-decoration-line: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">WordPress.org</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> 免费下载，或者</span><a style=\"text-decoration-line: none;\" href=\"https://localwp.com\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: #1155cc; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; text-decoration-line: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">使用 Local</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> 运行一个本地实例。你也可以在 </span><a style=\"text-decoration-line: none;\" href=\"https://wordpress.com/\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: #1155cc; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; text-decoration-line: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">WordPress.com</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> 上创建一个。（注意：在 WordPress.com 上安装插件需要商业版套餐）</span></p></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">进入你 WordPress 信息中心的</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">管理面板</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">，然后点击侧边栏菜单中的</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">插件</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">。</span></p></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">点击</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">添加新插件</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">。</span></p></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">搜索</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Material Design</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">。</span></p></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">在搜索结果中点击</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">立即安装</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">。</span></p></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">安装完成后，点击</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">启用</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">按钮。</span></p></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">按照</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">分步</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">快速开始（Quick Start）</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">指引安装 Material WordPress 主题和示例。</span></p></li>\n</ol>\n<h2>创建 Material 主题</h2>\n<p>在自定义器（customizer）中设置并预览你的全局 Material 主题样式。选择颜色、字体排印、形状和图标，彰显你的独特风格。关于如何自定义 Material 主题样式来体现产品的独特风格，请查看我们的<a href=\"https://material.io/blog/design-material-theme-color\">Material Theming 系列文章</a>。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<h2>用 Material 区块进行构建</h2>\n<p>添加按钮和卡片等 <a href=\"https://material.io/components\">Material Components</a>，为图片丰富的页面或美化过的联系表单等创建布局。你可以通过调整全局主题样式来自定义区块的外观，也可以在区块编辑器中设置单个组件的样式。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<h2>告诉我们你的想法</h2>\n<p>Material Design for WordPress 是一次实验。我们希望借此机会进一步了解你对 WordPress 上的 Material 体验有哪些期望和需求。喜欢它？不喜欢它？你希望看到哪些功能？你的反馈可以帮助我们理解构建内容型网站的人们对设计系统有什么需求，从而让 Web 版 Material 对每个人都更好。</p>\n<p>快来试用 <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/material-design/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Material Design for WordPress</a>，<a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/material-design/reviews/#new-post\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">直接在 WordPress 中分享你的反馈</a>，或在 Twitter 上发送推文给 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/materialdesign\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">@materialdesign</a>。</p>","image":[{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":"Start from our existing styles and use Material Theming to create a custom look and feel. Choose colors, typography, shapes, and icons to express your unique style.","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/5a50040fe4aae281998759402143ecd2ba0c9216902900d234b244d85b951c525743b4ed3afffa7aaacc4b28ac8adb45430d5fd626b40a800a60b9a4fad754fe","height":1024,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/l3Gw3dxN84yBxAHrO2Nu07fJhb2Dq-wwGa24EAwZyTLuAetKlAmqpwWfwYXZWFBWJhXbSRHXVgQ9z_Esz6J3EMNhZdx_v5BEETF5Hg","width":1440}},{"a11y_description":"Block for recent posts is added to an example blog page titled “Hello world!” and customized using the block editor","bordered":true,"caption":"Add Material blocks inline and customize them using the block editor panel.","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/051df57cc96c3526d5d15fbfe0730d9521532cb75ad607d21f072c0b0bd7124eeda26619afaccf4b508629c7b1f3ba3bcf9795ef1eb454ea02a9c36fdccc74b2","height":1024,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YliXgwzOuPcr5x1GQkk2lyHNLQshdlUsokoMcQCcH-y9ONov2uLShyisQ99s1Gn3dE287J7lzGyb78wHuZURfmYXCKBSLLa3ILRRhSw","width":1440}}],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[]}],"category":"2021","hero":{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/138a2dd6871eb784538af8154eef02c861ec51846d66a21eb531c987c6d01c7f0ce94cc5c69415c7fe9761646c40283683102ae59bfd1782c2f1bf1eb57ad618","height":2801,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/2bkL2_iRZf7rYM1J6Wq2ZvxWiGYwt8kNpHSW_ckOnSd9indURxfHRe0lnHcCbx3jA7OIE21yVMYlSJFtVcMfaNyEm55y8WyVVUM0bVA","width":5000}},"hero_card":false,"metadata":{"keywords":"Web, WordPress, Experiments","meta_robots":" ","schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"如何将 Material Design 直接应用于 WordPress 网站，无需编写代码","share_image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028